data: {"id": "86098c6c48c84959-thinking-parallel_evidence-61", "run_id": "86098c6c48c84959", "node": "parallel_evidence", "node_name": "parallel_evidence", "thinking_type": "tool_result", "tool_name": "TodoWrite", "content": null, "status": "success", "result_preview": "TodoWrite 输出摘要: raw_chars=688 lines=9\nInvestigation plan updated with 5 tasks.\n# CURRENT INVESTIGATION TASKS\n**Task Status**: 0 completed, 1 in progress, 4 pending\n[ ] [pod-yaml-spec] kubectl get pod ", "duration_seconds": null, "iteration": 1, "ts_ms": 1788796827095, "lane_stage": "evidence", "evidence_context": {"contract_version": "aiops.parallel-evidence-stream.v1", "group_id": "g1", "dimension": "other"}, "tool_call_id": "call_851b28a82a0644cea1a46f0a", "tool_sequence": 1, "semantic_success": true, "result": "TodoWrite 输出摘要: raw_chars=688 lines=9\nInvestigation plan updated with 5 tasks.\n# CURRENT INVESTIGATION TASKS\n**Task Status**: 0 completed, 1 in progress, 4 pending\n[ ] [pod-yaml-spec] kubectl get pod workload-dff5cbc6b-fkzvn -n aiops-case-07 -o yaml: 检查 command/args/image/probes。\n[ ] [previous-logs] kubectl logs workload-dff5cbc6b-fkzvn -n aiops-case-07 --previous --tail=200: 获取崩溃前日志。\n[ ] [pod-events] kubectl_events: 查看 Liveness probe failed / Killing 事件。\n[ ] [pod-restart-trend-range] execute_pod_promql range: 确认重启趋势是否在持续。\n[~] [pod-describe-status] kubectl_describe pod workload-dff5cbc6b-fkzvn -n aiops-case-07: 确认状态、Exit Code、Last State、重启次数。\n**Instructions**: Use TodoWrite tool to update task status as you work.", "raw_ref": "/tmp/aiops/reports/context_archives/86098c6c48c84959-g1/tools/004-evidence-TodoWrite.raw.txt", "structured_ref": "/tmp/aiops/reports/context_archives/86098c6c48c84959-g1/tools/004-evidence-TodoWrite.structured.json", "summary_ref": "/tmp/aiops/reports/context_archives/86098c6c48c84959-g1/tools/004-evidence-TodoWrite.summary.txt"}

