data: {"id": "86098c6c48c84959-thinking-parallel_evidence-135", "run_id": "86098c6c48c84959", "node": "parallel_evidence", "node_name": "parallel_evidence", "thinking_type": "tool_result", "tool_name": "TodoWrite", "content": null, "status": "success", "result_preview": "TodoWrite 输出摘要: raw_chars=891 lines=11\nInvestigation plan updated with 7 tasks.\n# CURRENT INVESTIGATION TASKS\n**Task Status**: 4 completed, 1 in progress, 2 pending\n[ ] [pod-yaml-probes] kubectl_get_y", "duration_seconds": null, "iteration": 3, "ts_ms": 1788796866978, "lane_stage": "evidence", "evidence_context": {"contract_version": "aiops.parallel-evidence-stream.v1", "group_id": "g1", "dimension": "other"}, "tool_call_id": "call_8f6d532e3c294c2299e90121", "tool_sequence": 6, "semantic_success": true, "result": "TodoWrite 输出摘要: raw_chars=891 lines=11\nInvestigation plan updated with 7 tasks.\n# CURRENT INVESTIGATION TASKS\n**Task Status**: 4 completed, 1 in progress, 2 pending\n[ ] [pod-yaml-probes] kubectl_get_yaml: 检查 readiness/liveness probe 配置与 exit code 详情。\n[ ] [pod-tracing-CONFIG_MISSING] query_pod_tracing: 查找 CONFIG_MISSING 对应的 L7 span/flow 以确认上游依赖。\n[~] [pod-current-logs] kubectl_logs --all-containers --tail=100: 确认当前容器启动日志/入口进程是否存活。\n[✓] [pod-describe-status] kubectl_describe pod workload-dff5cbc6b-fkzvn -n aiops-case-07: 确认状态、Exit Code、Last State、重启次数。\n[✓] [pod-yaml-spec] kubectl get pod workload-dff5cbc6b-fkzvn -n aiops-case-07 -o yaml: 检查 command/args/image/probes。\n[✓] [pod-previous-logs] kubectl logs workload-dff5cbc6b-fkzvn -n aiops-case-07 --previous --tail=200: 获取崩溃前日志。\n[✓] [pod-events] kubectl_events: 查看 Liveness probe failed / Killing 事件。\n**Instructions**: Use TodoWrite tool to update task status as you work.", "raw_ref": "/tmp/aiops/reports/context_archives/86098c6c48c84959-g1/tools/009-evidence-TodoWrite.raw.txt", "structured_ref": "/tmp/aiops/reports/context_archives/86098c6c48c84959-g1/tools/009-evidence-TodoWrite.structured.json", "summary_ref": "/tmp/aiops/reports/