event: thinking
data: {"id": "86098c6c48c84959-thinking-parallel_evidence-703", "run_id": "86098c6c48c84959", "node": "parallel_evidence", "node_name": "parallel_evidence", "thinking_type": "ai_message", "tool_name": null, "content": "根据当前工具结果，梳理对候选原因\"容器启动命令或入口进程错误\"的支持、冲突与缺口：\n\n### 1. 已确认事实（支持）\n- **Pod 状态**：`workload-dff5cbc6b-fkzvn` 当前处于 **CrashLoopBackOff**，重启次数已达 21 次（事件显示 `x377 over 84m`）。\n- **进程退出码**：YAML 和 Describe 结果显示容器 `app` 的退出码为 **`exitCode=78`**。该代码在 Python 应用中常用于表示配置缺失或环境变量未找到导致的初始化失败。\n- **崩溃前日志**：最近一次崩溃前，应用成功启动了 HTTP 服务，但在请求 `/work` 路径时返回了 **500 错误**，日志明确记录了 **`\"message\":\"CONFIG_MISSING\"`**。\n- **启动命令**：Pod 定义为 `command: [\"python3\", \"/opt/aiops/server.py\"]`。进程已成功启动并监听端口，而非因语法错误或文件不存在（Exit Code 1/2/127）而立即崩溃。\n\n### ", "status": null, "result_preview": null, "duration_seconds": null, "iteration": 4, "ts_ms": 1788796875535, "lane_stage": "evidence"}

event: node_complete
data: {"id": "86098c6c48c84959-node_complete-parallel_evidence", "run_id": "86098c6c48c84959", "seq": 704, "ts_ms": 1788796882638, "node": "parallel_evidence", "node_name": "并发证据采集", "duration_seconds": 81.371, "state_snapshot": {"contract_version": "aiops.parallel-evidence-output.v2", "group_count": 1, "expected_group_count": 1, "terminal_group_count": 1, "join_complete": true, "diagnosed_count": 1, "inconclusive_count": 0, "error_count": 0, "errors": [], "groups": [{"group_id": "g1", "presentation_index": 0, "entities": [{"kind": "Pod", "namespace": "aiops-case-07", "name": "workload-dff5cbc6b-fkzvn"}], "diagnostic_status": "diagnosed", "artifact_ref": {"path": "/tmp/aiops/reports/context_archives/86098c6c48c84959-g1/lane_artifacts/g1/artifact.json", "sha256": "b7501ce89ede4d58968265a3911431a9200a37a953862dad5475243801f6898e", "bytes": 2450}, "snapshot_sha256": "124022ef282a8eda4c816a3e725f17ebc2ec88c1ee4cdb3aef3440d4e833bd75"}]}, "handoff_summary": ""}

event: node_start
data: {"id": "86098c6c48c84959-node_start-conclusion", "run_id": "86098c6c48c84959", "seq": 705, "ts_ms": 1788796882639, "node": "conclusion", "node_name": "汇总总结"}

event: node_complete
data: {"id": "86098c6c48c84959-node_complete-conclusion", "run_id": "86098c6c48c84959", "seq": 706, "ts_ms": 1788796892761, "node": "conclusion", "node_name": "汇总总结", "duration_seconds": 10.122, "state_snapshot": {"conclusion_length": 1585, "has_errors": false, "has_warnings": false, "conclusion": "## 📊 异常概览与现象\n\n| 组 | 异常实体 | 异常状态 | 关键错误信息 |\n|---|---|---|---|\n| g1 | `aiops-case-07/workload-dff5cbc6b-fkzvn` | CrashLoopBackOff | CrashLoopBackOff (exitCode=78) |\n\n---\n\n## 🕵️ 证据内容 · g1\n\n| # | 类型 | 来源 | 真实原始结果 | 诊断作用 |\n|---|---|---|---|---|\n| 1 | K8s State | Kubernetes | `container.exit_code: 78`, `restart_count: 21` (fact-9a07b758b511, fact-1de97e9354b7) | 确认应用进程反复异常退出 |\n| 2 | K8s State | Kubernetes | `container.waiting_reason: CrashLoopBackOff`, `reason: Error` (fact-8f5699dd9688, fact-024db4e49e30) | 确认 K8s 层面已进入重启退避循环 |\n| 3 | K8s Event | Kubernetes | `BackOff 6s (x377 over 84m)`, `kubelet` (fact-beaab333efea) | 描述 kubelet 观察到反复失败后的具体退避行为 |\n| 4 | Logging | Elasticsearch | `pattern: CONFIG_MISSING`, `http_status: 500`, `path: /work` (fact-3cad91ff2a13 等) | 定位到具体的应用错误类型：配置缺失 |\n| 5 | Tracing | Deepflow/Tempo | `Flow: GET /work → 500`, `aiops.observed_mode: config_missing_exit` (fact-056e308a9210, fact-6247a5ec1776 等) | 关联了 HTTP 请求失败与应用配置异常退出状态 |\n\n**证据说明**：\nKubernetes 的 `CrashLoopBackOff` 状态（#2）由 `exitCode=78`（#1）触发。应用日志明确报出 `CONFIG_MISSING` 错误（#4），而 Tracing 证据进一步确认了该错误发生在处理 `/work` 请求时，且模式为 `config_missing_exit`（#5）。这三者形成了完整的闭环证据，证明应用因内部配置缺失导致进程终止，进而引发 K8s 的重启。\n\n## 🎯 根因分析 · g1\n\n### 因果链\n\n```text\nConfigMap workload-code 缺少应用关键配置键 → 请求触发 CONFIG_MISSING 报错并终止进程 → 容器以 exitCode 78 退出 → CrashLoopBackOff (exitCode=78)\n```\n\n### 根因结论\n\n**已确认的根因**：应用代码运行依赖的 ConfigMap (`workload-code`) 中缺失了关键配置项。\n\n这一配置缺失导致应用在处理请求（如 `GET /work`）时触发 `CONFIG_MISSING` 错误，直接致使进程以退出码 `78` 终止。该异常退出状态被 K8s 监控并判定为失败，最终触发 `CrashLoopBackOff` 状态。\n\n**已知局限**：虽然确认为“配置缺失”，但具体的缺失键名称未在观测数据中提供（见 `unknowns`）。", "conclusion_formatted": "## 📊 异常概览与现象\n\n| 组 | 异常实体 | 异常状态 | 关键错误信息 |\n|---|---|---|---|\n| g1 | `aiops-case-07/workload-dff5cbc6b-fkzvn` | CrashLoopBackOff | CrashLoopBackOff (exitCode=78) |\n\n---\n\n## 🕵️ 证据内容 · g1\n\n| # | 类型 | 来源 | 真实原始结果 | 诊断作用 |\n|---|---|---|---|---|\n| 1 | K8s State | Kubernetes | `container.exit_code: 78`, `restart_count: 21` (fact-9a07b758b511, fact-1de97e9354b7) | 确认应用进程反复异常退出 |\n| 2 | K8s State | Kubernetes | `container.waiting_reason: CrashLoopBackOff`, `reason: Error` (fact-8f5699dd9688, fact-024db4e49e30) | 确认 K8s 层面已进入重启退避循环 |\n| 3 | K8s Event | Kubernetes | `BackOff 6s (x377 over 84m)`, `kubelet` (fact-beaab333efea) | 描述 kubelet 观察到反复失败后的具体退避行为 |\n| 4 | Logging | Elasticsearch | `pattern: CONFIG_MISSING`, `http_status: 500`, `path: /work` (fact-3cad91ff2a13 等) | 定位到具体的应用错误类型：配置缺失 |\n| 5 | Tracing | Deepflow/Tempo | `Flow: GET /work → 500`, `aiops.observed_mode: config_missing_exit` (fact-056e308a9210, fact-6247a5ec1776 等) | 关联了 HTTP 请求失败与应用配置异常退出状态 |\n\n**证据说明**：\nKubernetes 的 `CrashLoopBackOff` 状态（#2）由 `exitCode=78`（#1）触发。应用日志明确报出 `CONFIG_MISSING` 错误（#4），而 Tracing 证据进一步确认了该错误发生在处理 `/work` 请求时，且模式为 `config_missing_exit`（#5）。这三者形成了完整的闭环证据，证明应用因内部配置缺失导致进程终止，进而引发 K8s 的重启。\n\n## 🎯 根因分析 · g1\n\n### 因果链\n\n```text\nConfigMap workload-code 缺少应用关键配置键 → 请求触发 CONFIG_MISSING 报错并终止进程 → 容器以 exitCode 78 退出 → CrashLoopBackOff (exitCode=78)\n```\n\n### 根因结论\n\n**已确认的根因**：应用代码运行依赖的 ConfigMap (`workload-code`) 中缺失了关键配置项。\n\n这一配置缺失导致应用在处理请求（如 `GET /work`）时触发 `CONFIG_MISSING` 错误，直接致使进程以退出码 `78` 终止。该异常退出状态被 K8s 监控并判定为失败，最终触发 `CrashLoopBackOff` 状态。\n\n**已知局限**：虽然确认为“配置缺失”，但具体的缺失键名称未在观测数据中提供（见 `unknowns`）。"}, "handoff_summary": ""}

event: final
data: {"id": "86098c6c48c84959-final", "run_id": "86098c6c48c84959", "seq": 708, "ts_ms": 1788796892770, "status": "success", "answer": "## 📊 异常概览与现象\n\n| 组 | 异常实体 | 异常状态 | 关键错误信息 |\n|---|---|---|---|\n| g1 | `aiops-case-07/workload-dff5cbc6b-fkzvn` | CrashLoopBackOff | CrashLoopBackOff (exitCode=78) |\n\n---\n\n## 🕵️ 证据内容 · g1\n\n| # | 类型 | 来源 | 真实原始结果 | 诊断作用 |\n|---|---|---|---|---|\n| 1 | K8s State | Kubernetes | `container.exit_code: 78`, `restart_count: 21` (fact-9a07b758b511, fact-1de97e9354b7) | 确认应用进程反复异常退出 |\n| 2 | K8s State | Kubernetes | `container.waiting_reason: CrashLoopBackOff`, `reason: Error` (fact-8f5699dd9688, fact-024db4e49e30) | 确认 K8s 层面已进入重启退避循环 |\n| 3 | K8s Event | Kubernetes | `BackOff 6s (x377 over 84m)`, `kubelet` (fact-beaab333efea) | 描述 kubelet 观察到反复失败后的具体退避行为 |\n| 4 | Logging | Elasticsearch | `pattern: CONFIG_MISSING`, `http_status: 500`, `path: /work` (fact-3cad91ff2a13 等) | 定位到具体的应用错误类型：配置缺失 |\n| 5 | Tracing | Deepflow/Tempo | `Flow: GET /work → 500`, `aiops.observed_mode: config_missing_exit` (fact-056e308a9210, fact-6247a5ec1776 等) | 关联了 HTTP 请求失败与应用配置异常退出状态 |\n\n**证据说明**：\nKubernetes 的 `CrashLoopBackOff` 状态（#2）由 `exitCode=78`（#1）触发。应用日志明确报出 `CONFIG_MISSING` 错误（#4），而 Tracing 证据进一步确认了该错误发生在处理 `/work` 请求时，且模式为 `config_missing_exit`（#5）。这三者形成了完整的闭环证据，证明应用因内部配置缺失导致进程终止，进而引发 K8s 的重启。\n\n## 🎯 根因分析 · g1\n\n### 因果链\n\n```text\nConfigMap workload-code 缺少应用关键配置键 → 请求触发 CONFIG_MISSING 报错并终止进程 → 容器以 exitCode 78 退出 → CrashLoopBackOff (exitCode=78)\n```\n\n### 根因结论\n\n**已确认的根因**：应用代码运行依赖的 ConfigMap (`workload-code`) 中缺失了关键配置项。\n\n这一配置缺失导致应用在处理请求（如 `GET /work`）时触发 `CONFIG_MISSING` 错误，直接致使进程以退出码 `78` 终止。该异常退出状态被 K8s 监控并判定为失败，最终触发 `CrashLoopBackOff` 状态。\n\n**已知局限**：虽然确认为“配置缺失”，但具体的缺失键名称未在观测数据中提供（见 `unknowns`）。\n\n---\n\n## 📊 性能统计\n\n```text\n├─ 总耗时: 1.8m\n├─ 问题定位: 17.8s\n├─ 并发证据采集: 81.4s\n│  └─ g1 aiops-case-07/workload-dff5cbc6b-fkzvn: 81.4s (Evidence 74.4s, RCA 6.8s)\n└─ 汇总总结: 10.1s\n```\n\n📋 Runbook 参考\n\n- **g1 aiops-case-07/workload-dff5cbc6b-fkzvn**: pod-crashloop-runtime\n", "answer_source": "workflow", "elapsed_seconds": 109.329, "metrics": {"run_id": "86098c6c48c84959", "mttr": {"value": "1.8m", "seconds": 109.33527970314026, "pass": true, "threshold": "< 10.0m"}, "evidence_completeness": {"value": "0%", "collected": 0, "planned": 0, "pass": false, "threshold": "> 90%"}, "root_cause_confidence": {"value": "42%", "pass": false, "threshold": ">= 80%"}, "runbook_coverage": {"matched": true, "runbook_id": "pod-crashloop-runtime", "pass": true, "score": 0.8667, "breakdown": [{"description": "Runbook 引用", "weight": 0.5, "score": 1.0, "weighted_score": 0.5}, {"description": "核心 Runbook 识别", "weight": 0.3, "score": 1.0, "weighted_score": 0.3}, {"description": "Runbook 结论关联", "weight": 0.2, "score": 0.3333333333333333, "weighted_score": 0.0667}]}, "confidence_breakdown": [{"name": "evidence_strength", "weight": 0.35, "score": 0.0, "weighted_score": 0.0, "description": "加权证据完整率", "detail": "加权完整率 0%"}, {"name": "causal_chain", "weight": 0.2, "score": 0.7, "weighted_score": 0.14, "description": "因果链完整性", "detail": "部分因果链"}, {"name": "tool_coverage", "weight": 0.1, "score": 0.3, "weighted_score": 0.03, "description": "关键探针覆盖率", "detail": "工具成功率 30%"}, {"name": "runbook_match", "weight": 0.15, "score": 1.0, "weighted_score": 0.15, "description": "Runbook 匹配质量", "detail": "核心: pod-crashloop-runtime"}, {"name": "llm_self_score", "weight": 0.2, "score": 0.5, "weighted_score": 0.1, "description": "LLM 自评分数", "detail": "来源: layer_confidence, 分数: 50%"}], "confidence_penalties": [], "evidence_breakdown": {"total": 0, "breakdown": {}}, "performance": {"total_duration_ms": 109335.27970314026, "llm_calls": 16, "llm_duration_ms": 72552.38914489746, "tool_calls": 17, "executed_tool_calls": 13, "deduplicated_tool_calls": 3, "successful_tool_calls": 15, "failed_tool_calls": 2, "tool_duration_ms": 50726.32622718811, "tool_wall_duration_ms": 36345.65544128418}, "nodes": {"layer": {"name": "问题定位", "duration_ms": 17823.42624664306